{"v":1,"lang":"de","open":true,"title":"Prometheus für Balboa","slides":["<section id=\"cover\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#17181C;color:#F5F3EE;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F07528\">Prometheus × Balboa</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px\">\n<h1 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.05;text-transform:uppercase;width:1500px\">Gebaut mit Balboa</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:44px;line-height:1.3;color:#B4B8BF;width:1400px\">Eine Software, die sich nach Ihrem Studio richtet. Nicht umgekehrt.</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:64px;width:1664px;font-size:24px;color:#B4B8BF\">Prometheus · ein Produkt der Peakforce GmbH, Zollikon · Zürich, 12. November 2026</p>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"unterschied\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Der Unterschied</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Kenko ist ein Standardprodukt. Balboa ist kein Standard.</h2>\n</div>\n<table style=\"font-size:32px;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:34%\"> </th><th style=\"width:33%;color:#5A5E66\">Kenko</th><th style=\"width:33%;color:#A9460F\">Prometheus</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Wer bestimmt, was gebaut wird</td><td style=\"color:#5A5E66\">Die Roadmap des Anbieters</td><td><b>Balboa, gemeinsam mit uns</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Eine neue Idee für Mitglieder</td><td style=\"color:#5A5E66\">Ein Wunsch auf einer Liste</td><td><b>Gebaut, getestet, live in der App</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Verwaltung pro Monat</td><td style=\"color:#5A5E66\">Rund 4 Stunden</td><td><b>Rund 2 Stunden</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ansprechpartner</td><td style=\"color:#5A5E66\">Der Support des Anbieters</td><td><b>Der Gründer, direkt</b></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"schondrin\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#17181C;color:#F5F3EE;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F07528\">Kein Musterstudio</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Ihr Studio läuft schon in Prometheus</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-top:6px solid #F07528;padding:32px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#F07528\">2</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#B4B8BF\">Standorte: Schanzengraben und Viadukt</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-top:6px solid #F07528;padding:32px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#F07528\">333</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#B4B8BF\">Ihrer Kurse, 9. November bis 1. Dezember</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-top:6px solid #F07528;padding:32px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#F07528\">26</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#B4B8BF\">Ihrer Trainerinnen und Trainer, mit Foto</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-top:6px solid #F07528;padding:32px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#F07528\">8</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#B4B8BF\">Ihrer Angebote, vom Starter Kit bis zum Jahresabo</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:44px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600\">Was Sie gleich sehen, ist Balboa. Nicht ein Beispiel.</p>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:64px;width:1664px;font-size:24px;color:#B4B8BF\">Mitglieder und Buchungen in der Demo sind erfunden. Kurse, Trainer und Preise sind Ihre.</p>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"vorhang\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#17181C;color:#F5F3EE;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:48px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F07528\">Das Versprechen</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.05;text-transform:uppercase;width:1664px\">Was Sie im Office planen, steht direkt an der Front</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:44px;line-height:1.3;color:#B4B8BF;width:1400px\">Ein Kurs, eine Regel, eine neue Ansicht: Sie richten es im Studio ein, Ihre Mitglieder sehen es sofort in der App.</p>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"weg\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:72px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">So funktioniert es</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Ein System, keine Übergabe</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border:1px solid #DCD8CF\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A5E66\">Im Office</h3>\n<ul style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.5\">\n<li>Kurse und Zeiten</li>\n<li>Regeln für Buchungen</li>\n<li>Neue Ansichten</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<x-shape kind=\"arrow-right\" style=\"background:#F07528;width:120px;height:60px\"></x-shape>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;background:#17181C;color:#F5F3EE;padding:40px\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F07528\">Prometheus</h3>\n<ul style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.5\">\n<li>Alles an einem Ort</li>\n<li>Keine zweite Software</li>\n<li>Studio und App zugleich</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<x-shape kind=\"arrow-right\" style=\"background:#F07528;width:120px;height:60px\"></x-shape>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border:1px solid #DCD8CF\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">An der Front</h3>\n<ul style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.5\">\n<li>iOS und Android</li>\n<li>Sofort sichtbar</li>\n<li>Ohne Zwischenschritt</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"rollen\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Ein Plan für alle</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Vier Rollen, ein Kursplan</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1\">Management</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Plant Kurse, Schichten und Preise für beide Standorte.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1\">Trainer</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Sieht die eigenen Kurse und PT-Stunden, baut Trainingspläne.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1\">Empfang</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Check-in, Verkauf und der heutige Tag auf einen Blick.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#17181C;color:#F5F3EE;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;color:#F07528\">Mitglied</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#B4B8BF\">Bucht in der App, an beiden Standorten, mit denselben Credits.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:44px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600\">Ändert einer etwas, sehen es alle anderen sofort.</p>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"pt\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:72px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Personal Training</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Das Studio plant, der Trainer coacht</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border:1px solid #DCD8CF\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A5E66\">Im Studio</h3>\n<ul style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.5\">\n<li>PT-Termine im Kalender</li>\n<li>Pakete und Abrechnung</li>\n<li>Schicht und Raum</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<x-shape kind=\"arrow-right\" style=\"background:#F07528;width:120px;height:60px\"></x-shape>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;background:#17181C;color:#F5F3EE;padding:40px\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F07528\">Beim Trainer</h3>\n<ul style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.5\">\n<li>Ein Klick in die Coaching-App</li>\n<li>Trainingspläne bauen</li>\n<li>Fortschritt sehen</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<x-shape kind=\"arrow-right\" style=\"background:#F07528;width:120px;height:60px\"></x-shape>\n<div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border:1px solid #DCD8CF\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Beim Kunden</h3>\n<ul style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.5\">\n<li>Die eigene Stunde in der App</li>\n<li>Der Plan vom Trainer</li>\n<li>Privat: nur für ihn sichtbar</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"demo\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F07528;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase\">Live-Demo</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.05;text-transform:uppercase;width:1600px\">Hinter dem Vorhang, vor dem Vorhang</h2>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border-top:4px solid #17181C;padding:24px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:700\">1</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.3\">Die Woche planen und mit einem Klick veröffentlichen</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border-top:4px solid #17181C;padding:24px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:700\">2</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.3\">Trainer tauschen: der neue Name steht sofort in der App</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border-top:4px solid #17181C;padding:24px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:700\">3</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.3\">Lena bucht auf dem Handy, das Studio sieht es</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border-top:4px solid #17181C;padding:24px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:700\">4</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.3\">Andrea springt in ihre Coaching-App</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"idee\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 440px;gap:96px;align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:40px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Ihre Idee, unser nächster Sprint</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Sehen, wer mitkommt</h2>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Mitglieder sehen, wer in welche Gruppenklasse geht, und entscheiden selbst, wem sie zeigen, wann sie trainieren.</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.5\">\n<li>Sichtbar für alle, für Freunde oder für niemand</li>\n<li>Die Gruppenklasse wird zum Treffpunkt</li>\n<li>Wer sich verabredet, kommt</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;color:#5A5E66\">Entwurf der Ansicht in der Mitglieder-App</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;background:#17181C;color:#F5F3EE;padding:32px;border-radius:48px;border:6px solid #2E3036\">\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;color:#B4B8BF\">Mittwoch, 18. November</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#26282E;padding:24px;border-radius:20px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;font-weight:600\">18:30 · Strength</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n<x-shape kind=\"ellipse\" style=\"background:#F07528;width:44px;height:44px\"></x-shape>\n<x-shape kind=\"ellipse\" style=\"background:#6B8FD6;width:44px;height:44px\"></x-shape>\n<x-shape kind=\"ellipse\" style=\"background:#D9C9A8;width:44px;height:44px\"></x-shape>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;color:#B4B8BF\">Lena, Marco und 4 weitere</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#26282E;padding:24px;border-radius:20px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;font-weight:600\">19:30 · Conditioning</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n<x-shape kind=\"ellipse\" style=\"background:#6B8FD6;width:44px;height:44px\"></x-shape>\n<x-shape kind=\"ellipse\" style=\"background:#F07528;width:44px;height:44px\"></x-shape>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;color:#B4B8BF\">2 Freunde gehen hin</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;color:#B4B8BF\">Mich zeigen für</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:8px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #4A4D55\">Alle</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:600;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:#F07528;color:#17181C\">Freunde</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #4A4D55\">Niemand</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;padding:16px;border-radius:16px;background:#F07528;color:#17181C\">Platz buchen</p>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"bausteine\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Ihre Wünsche vom 30. Oktober</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Vier Bausteine, einer steht schon</h2>\n</div>\n<table style=\"font-size:32px;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:8%\">#</th><th style=\"width:62%\">Baustein</th><th style=\"width:30%\">Stand</th></tr>\n<tr><td><b>1</b></td><td>Was im Office geplant wird, steht direkt an der Front</td><td style=\"color:#A9460F\"><b>Live, heute in der Demo</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>2</b></td><td>Sehen, wer mitkommt</td><td><b>Nächster Sprint</b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>3</b></td><td>Monatsplanung in 2 statt 4 Stunden</td><td style=\"color:#5A5E66\">Mit Ihrem Team messen</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>4</b></td><td>Schichtbörse: Schichten abgeben und übernehmen</td><td style=\"color:#5A5E66\">Gemeinsam entwerfen</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"font-size:44px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600\">Zwölf Tage nach unserem ersten Gespräch.</p>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"bauen\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Zusammenarbeit</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">So bauen wir mit Balboa</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#F07528\">1</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1\">Sie sagen, was fehlt</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Im Gespräch, per Nachricht oder an der Theke.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#F07528\">2</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1\">Wir bauen es</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Entwurf, kurze Abstimmung mit Ihnen, Umsetzung.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#F07528\">3</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1\">Es ist live</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Im Studio und in der Mitglieder-App zugleich.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:44px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600\">Ihre Ideen landen nicht auf einer Wunschliste.</p>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"zeit\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Verwaltung pro Monat</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Die Hälfte der Zeit am Schreibtisch</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:48px;border:1px solid #DCD8CF\">\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;font-weight:600;color:#5A5E66\">Mit Kenko</p>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:200px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#5A5E66\">4 Std.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#17181C;color:#F5F3EE;padding:48px\">\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;font-weight:600\">Mit Prometheus</p>\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:200px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:#F07528\">2 Std.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Mitglieder, Buchungen, Zahlungen und Nachrichten an einem Ort. Was sich jeden Monat wiederholt, läuft von selbst.</p>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"plattform\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px 128px 160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:64px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Gesamte Plattform · letzte 12 Monate</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Gebaut für Masse</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-top:6px solid #F07528;padding:32px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1\">16’599</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Logins</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-top:6px solid #F07528;padding:32px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1\">41’991</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Trainingssätze erfasst</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-top:6px solid #F07528;padding:32px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1\">1’498</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Trainingsvideos verarbeitet</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;border-top:6px solid #F07528;padding:32px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:120px;font-weight:700;line-height:1\">1’222</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Videos mit Hantel­geschwindigkeit ausgewertet</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:44px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600\">Dieselbe Plattform, auf der Balboa laufen wird.</p>\n<p style=\"position:absolute;left:128px;bottom:64px;width:1664px;font-size:24px;color:#5A5E66\">Prometheus Coach, Studio, Enterprise und Mitglieder-Apps · Stand 11. November 2026</p>\n\n</section>\n","<section id=\"schweiz\" data-transition=\"fade\" style=\"background:#F5F3EE;color:#17181C;font-family:'Archivo', Arial, sans-serif;padding:128px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:72px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px\">\n<p style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9460F\">Ihr Partner</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:72px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase\">Schweizer Software, einen Anruf entfernt</h2>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1\">Daten in Zürich</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Gehostet in Zürich, unter Schweizer Datenschutz.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;border-top:6px solid #F07528\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family:'Oswald', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:44px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1\">Direkter Draht</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;color:#5A5E66\">Mittlere Antwortzeit: 22 Minuten. Und zwar vom Gründer, nicht von einer Hotline.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"displ